[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
PdfCraft opens and saves files through the XDG desktop portal, which
needs a D-Bus session bus.  If your desktop does not start one, run
PdfCraft under one, for example with

  dbus-run-session pdfcraft

PdfCraft renders with Vulkan when a Vulkan driver is installed and falls
back to OpenGL (EGL) otherwise; PDFCRAFT_RENDERER=gl forces OpenGL.

Printing goes through CUPS (lp and lpstat).  Install print/cups to print
to a printer; without it the Print dialog still offers Save as PDF.
EOM
}
]
